    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really that they moved away though. it's more like everyone just decided i don't exist anymore. i see them in the halls and they all just turn around or look at their phones. it's not just being lonely, it's like the world is better off without me even being in it. i'm just a burden to everyone i ever knew.",
