      "content": "but there is no one left to talk to. that's the thing. i've tried everyone and they all just... they've all moved on. it's like the version of me they knew is gone and this version is just a mistake. i don't think anyone would even notice if i just wasn't part of the picture anymore. everything feels so heavy and there's just no way to fix it. it's permanent.",
